# lenovo-linux.lines: Linux's `measure: result:` line for each scene of the
# test bed's harness on the Lenovo, the rung native-linux, under a headless
# Weston of the harness's own, which the native cases testbed/* of
# tests/native/gpu.cases print beside Rach2's native-rach2 lines. A line is
# the harness's last line as it printed it, after a comment naming the boot,
# its kernel and its IOMMU setting. The Debian boot of 83-15 adds them.
